  (text "U1 nRF52810-QCAA (ESB proprietary + BLE DFU only) / U2-U3 2x CY8CMBR3116 touch (0x37/0x38) / U4 LTC4120-4.2 charger L1 / U5 BQ29700 + Q1 protector L2 / U6 XC6206P302 3V0. Labels-only wiring (no wire crossings). ERC-directed by construction; ERC run is TOOL-RUN-TBD (no shell on this box) — see notes/BALL_REVIEW.md. DO NOT FAB."
